  characterID: occult_guardian
  displayName: Occult Guardian
  description: "Once an ordinary keeper of the library in the Temple of the Abyss, where the knowledge that binds the world of people to the spirits was kept. When the Temple fell, he made a pact with a voice from the dark to save the sacred books. The flames burned his soul away, and his body became a vessel for someone else's will."
